# Testing Rules

## Project mapping

Each `src/MyNet.Avalonia.*` package has a matching `tests/MyNet.Avalonia.*.Tests` project.
Headless tests: `*.Headless.Tests` for visual/template behavior.

## Coverage thresholds (`build/coverage/assembly-thresholds.json`)

| Assembly | Minimum line rate |
|----------|-------------------|
| Default | 50% |
| Controls | 60% |
| Extended, Geography, Core | 70% |
| Theme | 50% |

## What to test for controls

- Property get/set and coercion
- Pseudo-class toggling
- Commands and events
- Template application (headless)
- Culture change behavior (if localized)

## Commands

```bash
dotnet test MyAvalonia.slnx
dotnet test /p:CollectCoverage=true
```

Public controls are framework contracts — add tests with new public API.
